@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tokenUrl = http://localhost:8081/realms/autoservice/protocol/openid-connect/token

### Токен адміністратора
POST {{tokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=autoservice-api&username=manager&password=manager123

> {% client.global.set("lab5AdminToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Зведення каталогу — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/catalog/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{lab5AdminToken}}

### Фоновий експорт — 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/catalog/export
Authorization: Bearer {{lab5AdminToken}}
